  "details": "For a lot of us content creators, we used drone shots and animated camera options to zoom through the worlds for amazing vids and photography. So many of us are missing this, we would love to have it back, a way to move the camera like a drone, but even more so, a way to place a veiw point in different parts of the world, and be able to have the camera move along a line and follow the set up we have. Such as putting points around us in a circle and the camera follows it and spins in a circle around us! I'm not the best at explaining but we as content creators would love it🙏!",
